Thanks", "Sorry for losing track of this. Marking this as accepted, since the corresponding issue is accepted. @sstern6 Do you mind updating the description to reference the issue?

@platinumazure have your comments been addressed?", "Apologies @sstern6 and @kaicataldo, yes, my concerns are addressed.", "Thanks for contributing to ESLint!"]

