issue_description:
Hi, as I'm not sure if it's a bug or intended behavior, I'm opening a Support issue.

When `TextField` is being used with "outlined" variant, this style is being applied
```
.MuiFormHelperText-contained {
    margin: 8px 12px 0;
}
```

because of that, `helperText` is no longer aligned with the input field.
You can check the behavior on  textfield's demo: https://codesandbox.io/s/hoiog (set `helperText` to any value)

this style is even overwriting a correct class when `dense` margin is applied
```
.MuiFormHelperText-marginDense {
    margin-top: 4px;
}
```

Could you confirm if it's a intended behavior or a bug?

Kind regards,
Elmer

