### Steps to reproduce 🕹

Link to live example:

Steps:

1. `yarn add @mui/material @mui/lab @mui/x-data-grid-premium`
2. Attempt to create a custom theme with support for lab + premium theme augmentation.
```ts
import type {} from '@mui/lab/themeAugmentation';
import { createTheme } from '@mui/material/styles';
import type {} from '@mui/x-data-grid-premium/themeAugmentation';

createTheme()
```
4. Attempt to compile with these two theme augmentations.


