```

### Expected behavior 🤔

Should compile successfully.

### Context 🔦

I want to be able to use theme augmentation from these two libs together, but they aren't compatible without creating a custom module augmentation.

The current workaround is

```ts
import type { LabComponentNameToClassKey } from '@mui/lab/themeAugmentation';
import type { DataGridPremiumComponentNameToClassKey } from '@mui/x-data-grid-premium/themeAugmentation';

// this is a hack because `lab` and `data-grid-premium` don't agree about what module
// to augment
declare module '@mui/material/styles/overrides' {
  // eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-empty-interface
  interface ComponentNameToClassKey
    extends LabComponentNameToClassKey,
      DataGridPremiumComponentNameToClassKey {}
}
```

